1
00:00:46,399 --> 00:00:47,719
Zhang Tianyou!

2
00:00:47,719 --> 00:00:49,240
What on earth did you do to me?

3
00:00:49,560 --> 00:00:51,039
Untie me right now!

4
00:00:56,399 --> 00:00:58,799
You're asking what I did to you?

5
00:00:59,159 --> 00:01:01,240
You should ask yourself what you did to me!

6
00:01:01,240 --> 00:01:02,039
Look, just look!

7
00:01:10,040 --> 00:01:11,680
Zhang Tianyou, what are you doing?

8
00:01:11,680 --> 00:01:12,439
Forgive me.

9
00:01:13,760 --> 00:01:15,719
Zhang Tianyou, untie me right now!

10
00:01:16,680 --> 00:01:19,040
Last night, your fiery passion...

11
00:01:19,040 --> 00:01:20,840
...was truly hard to control.

12
00:01:21,319 --> 00:01:22,200
Your husband, on the other hand...

13
00:01:22,200 --> 00:01:23,239
...has a weak constitution,

14
00:01:23,239 --> 00:01:24,560
and couldn't withstand your wildness.

15
00:01:24,560 --> 00:01:26,680
I had no choice but to resort to this.

16
00:01:26,760 --> 00:01:28,000
You won't blame me, will you?

17
00:01:32,519 --> 00:01:33,319
Young Master!

18
00:01:40,280 --> 00:01:41,439
Qi Lianhai is dead.

19
00:01:41,879 --> 00:01:43,359
His son is waiting downstairs.

20
00:02:01,879 --> 00:02:04,760
My condolences, Young Master Qi.

21
00:02:04,760 --> 00:02:08,560
Sitting before you is the Qi Family head.

22
00:02:09,199 --> 00:02:10,159
Zhang Tianyou.

23
00:02:10,840 --> 00:02:12,560
I really have to thank you.

24
00:02:14,599 --> 00:02:15,879
There's no need to thank me.

25
00:02:15,960 --> 00:02:19,199
This was all through your own effort.

26
00:02:19,719 --> 00:02:20,919
Hand it over.

27
00:02:23,400 --> 00:02:24,400
You mean...

28
00:02:25,039 --> 00:02:25,719
The congratulatory gift?

29
00:02:25,719 --> 00:02:28,960
The Sheng Family Curse Scripture and Mei Family Celestial Seal.

30
00:02:29,599 --> 00:02:31,280
My father was killed by evil creatures.

31
00:02:31,280 --> 00:02:32,599
Soon it'll be my turn.

32
00:02:33,439 --> 00:02:35,439
Seven days to the Life-Returning Deadline.

33
00:02:35,759 --> 00:02:38,319
Finding the Tidal Tomb can't be delayed.

34
00:02:38,319 --> 00:02:40,400
The Chief candidate to find that tomb...

35
00:02:40,400 --> 00:02:42,159
...must be outside The Four Great Families.

36
00:02:42,280 --> 00:02:43,199
Didn't your father tell you?

37
00:02:43,199 --> 00:02:45,199
I'll find this person myself.

38
00:02:45,919 --> 00:02:47,759
But it absolutely can't be Zhang Tianyou.

39
00:02:49,599 --> 00:02:50,400
Miss Mei.

40
00:02:51,400 --> 00:02:53,919
Whatever the Mei Family is scheming,

41
00:02:54,080 --> 00:02:55,599
do you think I don't know?

42
00:02:58,360 --> 00:02:59,039
Look at this!

43
00:02:59,039 --> 00:03:00,479
Look what you've done to her!

44
00:03:00,639 --> 00:03:01,439
Stand back when you speak.

45
00:03:02,479 --> 00:03:03,680
Hand it over.

46
00:03:04,120 --> 00:03:05,039
Nobody move!

47
00:03:11,360 --> 00:03:12,319
Mei Jiushuang,

48
00:03:12,319 --> 00:03:14,199
I suggest you hurry back home.

49
00:03:14,759 --> 00:03:18,000
Young Master Li is still waiting for you.

50
00:03:26,280 --> 00:03:28,520
Qi Tiankun, what are you doing?

51
00:03:28,520 --> 00:03:29,199
Cousin,

52
00:03:29,520 --> 00:03:32,159
I've always remembered what you told me.

53
00:03:32,360 --> 00:03:34,400
I've killed my brother now,

54
00:03:34,400 --> 00:03:35,599
and I control the entire Qi Family.

55
00:03:35,599 --> 00:03:37,800
I'll soon rid you of this useless live-in son-in-law.

56
00:03:40,879 --> 00:03:41,879
Qi Tiankun,

57
00:03:42,280 --> 00:03:44,759
you can't run wild in the Sheng Family.

58
00:03:44,919 --> 00:03:46,479
Did you really think I fell for you?

59
00:03:46,680 --> 00:03:47,639
Let me tell you,

60
00:03:48,000 --> 00:03:50,680
you were just my tool to handle your brother!

61
00:03:53,400 --> 00:03:54,439
And as for you two...

62
00:03:54,759 --> 00:03:56,840
Miss Sheng, don't be impulsive.

63
00:03:57,879 --> 00:03:59,759
I have the Celestial Seal and Earth Curse Scripture.

64
00:03:59,960 --> 00:04:01,400
I'm the true head of the Sheng Family.

65
00:04:01,759 --> 00:04:02,680
Zhang Tianyou,

66
00:04:02,719 --> 00:04:04,439
I'll give you one last chance.

67
00:04:04,439 --> 00:04:05,840
Her or me?

68
00:04:11,680 --> 00:04:13,159
Excellent.

69
00:04:13,159 --> 00:04:15,080
This is exactly the outcome I wanted to see.

70
00:04:15,560 --> 00:04:17,680
I only want to find the Tidal Tomb now.

71
00:04:18,199 --> 00:04:20,399
Men, drag her away!

72
00:04:21,240 --> 00:04:22,319
Don't touch me, I can...

73
00:04:23,439 --> 00:04:24,879
I said I can walk!

74
00:04:24,879 --> 00:04:26,839
I... I can walk!

75
00:04:33,000 --> 00:04:34,040
Let's go.

76
00:04:41,680 --> 00:04:42,600
Lingyu.

77
00:04:42,600 --> 00:04:44,279
You... You don't even like me.

78
00:04:44,600 --> 00:04:46,040
Yet you made me do this...

79
00:04:46,040 --> 00:04:47,279
What are you doing?

80
00:05:10,199 --> 00:05:11,040
Get in.

81
00:05:22,839 --> 00:05:23,680
Li Xiao.

82
00:05:24,439 --> 00:05:25,360
Why are you here?

83
00:05:26,240 --> 00:05:27,120
Jiushuang.

84
00:05:27,399 --> 00:05:28,519
Don't touch me.

85
00:05:32,519 --> 00:05:34,959
Jiushuang, are you okay?

86
00:05:37,199 --> 00:05:40,279
Jiushuang, I know you've always been biased against me.

87
00:05:40,839 --> 00:05:42,439
But I genuinely came here to find you.

88
00:05:43,519 --> 00:05:46,399
I didn't expect them to lock me up.

89
00:05:53,560 --> 00:05:57,160
You were already engaged to me,

90
00:05:57,160 --> 00:05:59,800
yet you secretly hooked up with Wan Chun'er.

91
00:06:00,800 --> 00:06:02,360
How can I possibly trust you?

92
00:06:02,920 --> 00:06:05,519
Jiushuang, you've really misunderstood.

93
00:06:05,839 --> 00:06:07,240
When I went to the Wan family before,

94
00:06:07,240 --> 00:06:10,000
it was to discuss how, as Chief of The Four Great Families,

95
00:06:10,000 --> 00:06:12,959
I'd find Dragon Seeker heirs for the Tidal Tomb.

96
00:06:15,399 --> 00:06:17,560
I don't expect you to understand my good intentions.

97
00:06:17,959 --> 00:06:20,959
Now the Qi and Sheng Family heads have died suddenly.

98
00:06:21,399 --> 00:06:25,079
The Life-Returning Death Deadline is no rumor.

99
00:06:25,959 --> 00:06:26,759
Jiushuang.

100
00:06:28,160 --> 00:06:31,040
From now on, I will definitely protect you.

101
00:06:38,759 --> 00:06:40,800
I'll play along with your little act for now,

102
00:06:41,360 --> 00:06:43,120
to see what you're really plotting.

103
00:06:44,560 --> 00:06:46,319
She actually fell for it.

104
00:06:46,839 --> 00:06:49,000
Looks like I'm still as charming as ever.

105
00:06:50,360 --> 00:06:52,360
Feiyan, what are you doing here?

106
00:06:53,600 --> 00:06:56,680
We found where the Qi Family hid the original Talisman Book.

107
00:06:57,000 --> 00:06:57,720
Here.

108
00:06:59,920 --> 00:07:00,759
Zhang Tianyou,

109
00:07:00,759 --> 00:07:02,639
About The Four Great Families' expedition 20 years ago,

110
00:07:02,639 --> 00:07:03,800
what exactly is your connection to it?

111
00:07:05,040 --> 00:07:06,480
Are you willing to give me a straight answer?

112
00:07:06,480 --> 00:07:08,079
In seven days, when the moon is full,

113
00:07:08,079 --> 00:07:10,720
if The Four Great Families can truly break the Death Limit,

114
00:07:10,879 --> 00:07:11,920
I will naturally tell you.

115
00:07:12,519 --> 00:07:13,560
If you don't want to tell me, forget it.

116
00:07:14,160 --> 00:07:15,279
We're even now.

117
00:07:15,560 --> 00:07:16,839
I never want to see you again.

118
00:07:16,839 --> 00:07:18,639
Zhang Tianyou, who is she?

119
00:07:20,040 --> 00:07:20,480
She's...

120
00:07:20,480 --> 00:07:21,759
I'm his woman.

121
00:07:22,759 --> 00:07:23,720
What?

122
00:07:23,720 --> 00:07:24,720
What of it?

123
00:07:24,759 --> 00:07:26,439
He'd rather fool around outside

124
00:07:26,439 --> 00:07:29,079
than settle for a bratty canary like you.

125
00:07:29,519 --> 00:07:30,319
No, no, no, that's not it!

126
00:07:30,319 --> 00:07:31,000
We're not close.

127
00:07:31,000 --> 00:07:31,519
We just...

128
00:07:31,519 --> 00:07:32,759
slept together, that's all!

129
00:07:33,120 --> 00:07:33,959
When did that happen?!

130
00:07:39,040 --> 00:07:40,240
Zhang Tianyou!

131
00:07:42,759 --> 00:07:44,360
Get out! All of you, get the hell out!

132
00:07:44,360 --> 00:07:45,519
Get out of the Sheng Family!

133
00:07:59,839 --> 00:08:00,759
This is it.

134
00:08:01,759 --> 00:08:02,560
Young Master.

135
00:08:02,720 --> 00:08:05,319
Are you sure the Qi Family hid the original Talisman Book here?

136
00:08:05,319 --> 00:08:07,040
Leng Feiyan's Sand-Turning Gang

137
00:08:07,040 --> 00:08:09,000
is quite skilled at locating tombs.

138
00:08:09,000 --> 00:08:10,079
She wouldn't lie to me.

139
00:08:11,000 --> 00:08:12,560
Qi Lianhai was just murdered.

140
00:08:12,560 --> 00:08:15,519
She must have deduced this location from the clues.

141
00:08:16,120 --> 00:08:16,879
Let's go in.

142
00:08:20,439 --> 00:08:22,360
The Qi Family's Talisman Book should be inside.

143
00:08:22,360 --> 00:08:25,240
Finding it gives us leverage against The Four Great Families.

144
00:08:28,000 --> 00:08:28,959
What was that?

145
00:08:29,319 --> 00:08:30,040
Let's go!
